{
  "name": "Billing — Suscripciones MP (sandbox)",
  "description": "## Flujo E2E suscripciones SaaS (Mercado Pago)\n\n**Prerrequisitos**\n- `npm run start:dev` + `ngrok http 3000`\n- `.env`: `PAYMENT_GATEWAY_PROVIDER=mercadopago`, tokens MP\n- `MERCADOPAGO_SUBSCRIPTION_NOTIFICATION_URL` = `https://<ngrok>/api/payments/webhooks/mercadopago/subscriptions`\n- Panel MP: Webhooks (suscripciones / pagos según app) + `MERCADOPAGO_WEBHOOK_SECRET`\n- Seeds: `npm run db:seed:demo` (profesional demo)\n- Guía: `docs/how-to/mercadopago-subscriptions-sandbox.md`\n\n| Paso | Rol | Variable | Éxito |\n|------|-----|----------|-------|\n| 0 | — | — | 200 health |\n| 1 | PRO | — | planes PRO/BUSINESS USD |\n| 2 | PRO | `subscriptionInitPoint` | 201 + init_point |\n| manual | Comprador MP | — | Checkout suscripción en navegador |\n| 3 | PRO | — | `TRIALING` o `ACTIVE` (poll; **webhook real MP**) |\n| 4 | PRO | — | cancel 200 |\n\n**Manual:** abrir `{{subscriptionInitPoint}}` con usuario **comprador de prueba** MP. No simular webhook con POST inventado.",
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Health (API viva)",
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health/live"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": ["pm.test('API viva', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. GET billing/plans (PRO)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.environment.set('current_email', pm.environment.get('pro_email') || 'demo.pro@nexos.local');",
              "pm.environment.set('current_uid', pm.environment.get('pro_uid') || '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002');",
              "pm.environment.unset('access_token');"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Planes 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const plans = pm.response.json().plans || [];",
              "pm.test('Incluye PRO USD 5', () => {",
              "  const pro = plans.find((p) => p.code === 'PRO');",
              "  pm.expect(pro && pro.amountUsdCents === 500).to.be.true;",
              "});",
              "pm.test('Incluye BUSINESS USD 50', () => {",
              "  const biz = plans.find((p) => p.code === 'BUSINESS');",
              "  pm.expect(biz && biz.amountUsdCents === 5000).to.be.true;",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/billing/plans"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2. POST subscribe PRO",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.environment.set('current_email', pm.environment.get('pro_email') || 'demo.pro@nexos.local');",
              "pm.environment.set('current_uid', pm.environment.get('pro_uid') || '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002');",
              "pm.environment.unset('access_token');"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Subscribe 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
              "  const body = pm.response.json();",
              "  pm.environment.set('subscriptionId', body.subscriptionId);",
              "  pm.environment.set('subscriptionInitPoint', body.initPoint);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"plan\": \"PRO\"\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/billing/subscribe",
        "description": "Devuelve init_point MP. Abrir en navegador con comprador de prueba (paso manual)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "3. GET subscription (poll post-webhook)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.environment.set('current_email', pm.environment.get('pro_email') || 'demo.pro@nexos.local');",
              "pm.environment.set('current_uid', pm.environment.get('pro_uid') || '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002');",
              "pm.environment.unset('access_token');"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Subscription 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const s = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('Estado trial o activo', () => {",
              "  pm.expect(['TRIALING', 'ACTIVE', 'PAST_DUE', 'CANCELED']).to.include(s.status);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/billing/subscription",
        "description": "Repetir tras webhook real MP hasta ver TRIALING/ACTIVE coherente con BD."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4. POST subscription/cancel (opcional)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.environment.set('current_email', pm.environment.get('pro_email') || 'demo.pro@nexos.local');",
              "pm.environment.set('current_uid', pm.environment.get('pro_uid') || '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002');",
              "pm.environment.unset('access_token');"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Cancel 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Estado CANCELED', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('CANCELED'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/billing/subscription/cancel",
        "description": "Corta cobro recurrente en MP. Verificar preapproval canceled en panel MP."
      }
    }
  ]
}
